        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">X proximal_side_of Y &lt;=&gt; if Y is subdivided into distal and proximal portions, X is part_of the proximal portion.</obo:IAO_0000115>
