        <NDF-RT:MeSH_CUI>M0010233</NDF-RT:MeSH_CUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>D006525</NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>INFLAMMATION of the LIVER in humans due to infection by VIRUSES. There are several significant types of human viral hepatitis with infection caused by enteric-transmission (HEPATITIS A; HEPATITIS E) or blood transfusion (HEPATITIS B; HEPATITIS C; and HEPATITIS D).</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
