        <NDF-RT:Synonym>Myelogenous Leukemia, Ph1-Positive</NDF-RT:Synonym>
        <NDF-RT:Synonym>Myeloid Leukemia, Chronic</NDF-RT:Synonym>
        <NDF-RT:Synonym>Myeloid Leukemia, Ph1-Positive</NDF-RT:Synonym>
        <NDF-RT:Synonym>Myeloid Leukemia, Philadelphia-Positive</NDF-RT:Synonym>
