        <NDF-RT:MeSH_CUI>M0011815</NDF-RT:MeSH_CUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>D007559</NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>A mixture of mostly avermectin H2B1a (RN 71827-03-7) with some avermectin H2B1b (RN 70209-81-3), which are macrolides from STREPTOMYCES avermitilis. It binds glutamate-gated chloride channel to cause increased permeability and hyperpolarization of nerve and muscle cells. It also interacts with other CHLORIDE CHANNELS. It is a broad spectrum antiparasitic that is active against microfilariae of ONCHOCERCA VOLVULUS but not the adult form.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>Ivermectin</NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>
        <NDF-RT:NUI>N0000006374</NDF-RT:NUI>
        <NDF-RT:RxNorm_CUI>6069</NDF-RT:RxNorm_CUI>
        <NDF-RT:RxNorm_Name>Ivermectin</NDF-RT:RxNorm_Name>
