        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>A plant alkaloid with alpha-2-adrenergic blocking activity. Yohimbine has been used as a mydriatic in the treatment of ERECTILE DYSFUNCTION.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
