        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>Organic, monobasic acids derived from hydrocarbons by the equivalent of oxidation of a methyl group to an alcohol, aldehyde, and then acid. Fatty acids are saturated and unsaturated (FATTY ACIDS, UNSATURATED). (Grant &amp; Hackh&apos;s Chemical Dictionary, 5th ed)</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
