        <NDF-RT:MeSH_CUI>M0021024</NDF-RT:MeSH_CUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>D013629</NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>One of the SELECTIVE ESTROGEN RECEPTOR MODULATORS with tissue-specific activities. Tamoxifen acts as an anti-estrogen (inhibiting agent) in the mammary tissue, but as an estrogen (stimulating agent) in cholesterol metabolism, bone density, and cell proliferation in the ENDOMETRIUM.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>Tamoxifen</NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>
        <NDF-RT:NUI>N0000007041</NDF-RT:NUI>
        <NDF-RT:RxNorm_CUI>10324</NDF-RT:RxNorm_CUI>
