        <NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>D008139</NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>One of the long-acting synthetic ANTIDIARRHEALS; it is not significantly absorbed from the gut, and has no effect on the adrenergic system or central nervous system, but may antagonize histamine and interfere with acetylcholine release locally.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>Loperamide</NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>
        <NDF-RT:NUI>N0000007084</NDF-RT:NUI>
