        <NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>D005476</NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>A phenothiazine used in the treatment of PSYCHOSES. Its properties and uses are generally similar to those of CHLORPROMAZINE.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
