        <NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>D016207</NDF-RT:MeSH_DUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>Non-antibody proteins secreted by inflammatory leukocytes and some non-leukocytic cells, that act as intercellular mediators. They differ from classical hormones in that they are produced by a number of tissue or cell types rather than by specialized glands. They generally act locally in a paracrine or autocrine rather than endocrine manner.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>Cytokines</NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>
        <NDF-RT:NUI>N0000011291</NDF-RT:NUI>
