        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A bisbenzylisoquinoline alkaloid that is (1beta)- berbaman which has been substituted by methyl groups at the 2 and 2&apos; positions, by methoxy groups at the 6, 6&apos;, and 12 positions, and by a hydroxy group at position 7. Isolated from Stephania tetrandra, it has been found to possess neuroprotective and anti-tumour activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
