        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A heterodetic cyclic peptide is a peptide consisting only of amino-acid residues, but in which the linkages forming the ring are not solely peptide bonds; one or more is an isopeptide, disulfide, ester, or other bond.</obo:IAO_0000115>
