        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A small molecule which increases (activator) or decreases (inhibitor) the activity of an (allosteric) enzyme by binding to the enzyme at the regulatory site (which is different from the substrate-binding catalytic site).</obo:IAO_0000115>
