        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An addition compound contains two or more simpler compounds that can be packed in a definite ratio into a crystal. The term covers donor-acceptor complexes (adducts) and a variety of lattice compounds.</obo:IAO_0000115>
