        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A compound formally derived from an oxoacid RkE(=O)l(OH)m (l &gt; 0) and an alcohol, phenol, heteroarenol, or enol by linking with formal loss of water from an acidic hydroxy group of the former and a hydroxy group of the latter.</obo:IAO_0000115>
