        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A pyridoisoquinoline comprising emetam having methoxy substituents at the 6&apos;-, 7&apos;-, 10- and 11-positions. It is an antiprotozoal agent and emetic. It inhibits SARS-CoV2, Zika and Ebola virus replication and displays antimalarial, antineoplastic and antiamoebic properties.</obo:IAO_0000115>
