        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Primordia are populations of contiguous cells that are morphologically distinct and already correspond in extent to a later organ/tissue[FBbt, Hartenstein, V. (2004)].</obo:IAO_0000115>
