        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Joint in which the articulating bones or cartilages are connected by an articular capsule which encloses a synovial membrane and a synovial cavity. Examples: Temporomandibular joint, knee joint.[FMA]</obo:IAO_0000115>
