            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000116 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">compare with &apos;stratum basale of epidermis&apos;. This class is the source for many adult structures - see WP2062. See also: &apos;enveloping layer of ectoderm&apos;</obo:IAO_0000116>
