        <NDF-RT:Synonym>Hemorrhage, Cerebrum</NDF-RT:Synonym>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>Bleeding into one or both CEREBRAL HEMISPHERES including the BASAL GANGLIA and the CEREBRAL CORTEX. It is often associated with HYPERTENSION and CRANIOCEREBRAL TRAUMA.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
