        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>Inflammation of the COLON section of the large intestine (INTESTINE, LARGE), usually with symptoms such as DIARRHEA (often with blood and mucus), ABDOMINAL PAIN, and FEVER.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
