        <NDF-RT:NUI>N0000000807</NDF-RT:NUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>Inflammation of the COLON that is predominantly confined to the MUCOSA. Its major symptoms include DIARRHEA, rectal BLEEDING, the passage of MUCUS, and ABDOMINAL PAIN.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>Colitis, Ulcerative</NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>
