        <NDF-RT:NUI>N0000000839</NDF-RT:NUI>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>A heterogeneous group of disorders, some hereditary, others acquired, characterized by abnormal structure or function of one or more of the elements of connective tissue, i.e., collagen, elastin, or the mucopolysaccharides.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
        <rdfs:label>Connective Tissue Diseases [Disease/Finding]</rdfs:label>
