        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>An infection of the SMALL INTESTINE caused by the flagellated protozoan GIARDIA LAMBLIA. It is spread via contaminated food and water and by direct person-to-person contact.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
