        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>The clinical entity characterized by anorexia, diarrhea, loss of hair, leukopenia, thrombocytopenia, growth retardation, and eventual death brought about by the GRAFT VS HOST REACTION.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
