        <rdfs:label>Carcinoma, Hepatocellular [Disease/Finding]</rdfs:label>
        <NDF-RT:Synonym>Hepatocellular Carcinoma</NDF-RT:Synonym>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>A primary malignant neoplasm of epithelial liver cells. It ranges from a well-differentiated tumor with EPITHELIAL CELLS indistinguishable from normal HEPATOCYTES to a poorly differentiated neoplasm. The cells may be uniform or markedly pleomorphic, or form GIANT CELLS. Several classification schemes have been suggested.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
        <NDF-RT:SNOMED_CID>187769009</NDF-RT:SNOMED_CID>
        <NDF-RT:UMLS_CUI>C2239176</NDF-RT:UMLS_CUI>
