        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>Mycosis Fungoides</NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>A chronic, malignant T-cell lymphoma of the skin. In the late stages, the LYMPH NODES and viscera are affected.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
