        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>A form of cutaneous T-cell lymphoma manifested by generalized exfoliative ERYTHRODERMA; PRURITUS; peripheral lymphadenopathy, and abnormal hyperchromatic mononuclear (cerebriform) cells in the skin, LYMPH NODES, and peripheral blood (Sezary cells).</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
        <NDF-RT:Synonym>Sezary&apos;s Lymphoma</NDF-RT:Synonym>
