        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>Abnormally rapid heartbeat, usually with a HEART RATE above 100 beats per minute for adults. Tachycardia accompanied by disturbance in the cardiac depolarization (cardiac arrhythmia) is called tachyarrhythmia.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
