        <rdfs:label>Amino Acids, Peptides, and Proteins [Chemical/Ingredient]</rdfs:label>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>Amino acids and chains of amino acids connected by peptide linkages.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
