        <rdfs:label>Heterocyclic Compounds, 1-Ring [Chemical/Ingredient]</rdfs:label>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>A class of organic compounds containing a ring structure made up of more than one kind of atom, usually carbon plus another atom. The ring structure can be aromatic or nonaromatic.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
    </rdf:Description>
