        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>Cyclopentanophenanthrenes with a 6-membered lactone ring attached at the 17-position and SUGARS attached at the 3-position. They are found in BUFONIDAE and often possess cardiotonic properties.</NDF-RT:MeSH_Definition>
        <NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>Bufanolides</NDF-RT:MeSH_Name>
        <rdfs:label>Bufanolides [Chemical/Ingredient]</rdfs:label>
